Rāvaṇa meets cloud-borne Nārada while scaring mortals --- Nārada praises Viśravas birth and Viṣṇu-like crushings --- Nārada shows mortal joy grief and delusion --- Nārada asks why slay death-bound men --- Rāvaṇa laughs and plans Rasātala conquest and ocean churning --- Nārada warns this path leads to Yama --- Rāvaṇa vows southward to kill Vaivasvata keeping four-guardian vow --- Nārada wonders how Death is slain and follows curious
